Streamlit Application

The Streamlit application allows users to enter passenger details and receive predictions from all three trained machine learning models.

The application displays:

Passenger information input
Logistic Regression prediction
SVM prediction
KNN prediction
Overall model results
Technologies Used
Python
Pandas
Scikit-learn
